      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HARA'S DOLLY (4) finished in the placings last time but could not have been more impressive before that in her brilliant 19.69 win at Capalaba over 366m. Rates a top chance if runs up to time two back. RED RAPIDITY (7) has a strong winning strike-rate over this track and trip with three wins and a placing from six tries. Placed last time (30.45) at Q Parklands in a Grade 5, finishing third and beaten 2 lengths. Can hit the frame with the right run. MCKEON (1) is progressing well with another good run last time, placing (27.86) from Box 4 at Casino. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Expected to feature again. CRYSTAL DAYS (2) can measure up with the right run.",
